# =============================================================================
# Digital Asset Venture Intelligence environment variables
# =============================================================================
#
# The core application requires NO environment variables.
#
# Every Phase 2 capability (schemas, provenance, configuration loading, the
# historical cutoff rule, policy guards, and hashing) runs with no credential,
# no database, no account, and no external service. The build and the test
# suite both pass on a clean clone with this file untouched.
#
# A future phase will add the X Sourcing Engine. That module will require the
# reviewer to supply their own X API credential at run time. The credential
# will be request scoped: it will never be bundled, never persisted, never
# logged, and never committed. No credential field is defined here yet.
#
# Rule that applies to every variable this project will ever add:
# never use a NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix for a secret. A NEXT_PUBLIC_ variable is
# inlined into the browser bundle and is readable by anyone who loads the page.
#
# Optional, development only. Points a future research script at a private
# source archive that is never part of this repository. Leave unset.
# DAVI_SOURCE_DIR=
